OL,3,GNEWSAMen plead not guilty to terrorist
OL,4,Acharges over PSNI data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have pleaded not guilty to
OL,7,Fterrorist charges arising from a data
OL,8,Fbreach concerning serving Police
OL,9,FService of Northern Ireland (PSNI)
OL,10,Fofficers.
OL,12,FThe data breach occurred on 8 August
OL,13,F2023 when, under a Freedom of
OL,14,FInformation (FoI) request, the PSNI
OL,15,Freleased a spreadsheet by mistake.
OL,17,FThis spreadsheet contained in excess of
OL,18,F10,000 entries which included sensitive
OL,19,Finformation regarding a significant
OL,20,Fnumber of PSNI officers and staff.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
