OL,3,GNEWSAMen plead not guilty to terrorist
OL,4,Acharges over PSNI data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrian Francis Cavlan, 52, and
OL,7,F45-year-old Rory Martin Logan appeared
OL,8,Falongside each other in the dock of
OL,9,FBelfast Crown Court on Wednesday.
